then the five questions from data/<name>_questions.json with "Why we ask"
and the real transactions behind each, then into the app. Works for all
four personas. Answers earn question_answered; skipping earns nothing.

- build-data.js adds Mia's questions and finds data/mia_transactions.json
- audit: skips onboarding for the journey, new block walks it (184/184)
- CHANGES, web README and data contracts updated

